    "title": "Daniel Wong is the Fort Bend County Judge, for now - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By SESHADRI KUMAR ,\n1 days ago Fort Bend County Judge KP George was suspended from office on April 10 by visiting Judicial District Court Judge Jeth Jones of Galveston on a so-called citizen’s complaint calling for the removal of an elected official for “incompetence” and for restricting the citizen’s freedom of speech during the public comments period of a commissioners court meeting in September 2025. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
